Manufacturing\nAccelerator Ecosystem Alliances\nResearch\nShuttle\nMore +\nMy Intel Dashboard\nMy Tools\nSign Out\nSelect Language\nToggle Search\nAsk Intel\nAsk Intel\nAsk Intel\nQuick Links\nProduct Information\nSupport\nDrivers & Software\nRecent\nIntel® Arc™ GPUs\nSupercharge edge AI, graphics, and media processing.\nIntel® Arc™ GPUs\nProducts\nGaming\nAI Capabilities\nCreation\nResources\nExplore Intel Arc GPUs\nWhether you’re a serious gamer or content creator, someone just getting started, or a business looking to bring high-performance graphics to the cloud, Intel has a GPU to fit your needs, featuring new AI experiences1.\nIntel® Arc™ B-series GPUs for desktops\nExplore desktop GPUs\nIntel® Arc™ GPU-based laptops\nExplore laptop GPUs\nIntel® Arc™ Pro B-series GPUs for workstations\nExplore workstation GPUs\nIntel® Arc™ GPU for the edge\nExplore GPUs for the edge\nThe ultimate gaming experience\nBringing you high-performance gaming through advanced hardware like ray tracing units, Intel® XeSS, and specialized AI engines.\nSee Intel Arc GPUs for desktops\nSee Intel Arc GPUs for laptops\nSmoother gameplay in every frame\nGet faster, more fluid gameplay from the combination of Intel XeSS upscaling technology and frame generation.\nFaster response when it matters most\nExperience a hyper-connected gaming experience with reduced lag and input delays via Intel® Xe Low Latency (XeLL).\nPlay longer on every charge\nImmerse yourself in gameplay longer when you enable Endurance Gaming that helps you with power savings through customizable modes.\nAI enhanced graphics capabilities\nAdvance your creation and play capabilities with exciting AI tools and technologies including upscaled visuals, increased gaming performance, and generative AI capabilities.\nSee Intel Arc GPUs for laptops\nSee Intel Arc GPUs for desktops\nAI upscaling and faster content creation\nDynamic Intel® XMX AI Engines unlock cutting-edge AI experiences, including upscaled gaming and next-gen creation capabilities.\nLow latency that keeps you in control\nExperience a hyper-connected gaming experience with reduced lag and input delays via Intel® Xe Low Latency (Intel® XeLL).\nHigh-performance generative AI tools\nExperiment with AI creation such as editing effects and text-to-image applications, all easily accessible through Intel® AI Playground.2\nPower up your content creation\nRapidly create highly detailed design concepts in typical 2D applications and move them to 3D final models with the support of a powerful yet affordable GPU that can do it all. Go one step further using the dedicated GPU hardware that supercharges productivity.\nSee Intel Arc GPUs for laptops\nSee Intel Arc GPU for workstations\nCreate at 4K to 8K\nAdvanced Xe media engines with high throughput easily handle media creation in up to 4K resolution.\nFaster video exporting\nDual encode and decode capability to supercharge your video exporting.\nCross-codec support\nSupport for all the most popular media codecs for worry-free content creation.\nDiscover additional capabilities\nRay tracing acceleration\n• Recommended on Intel® Arc™ B-Series GPUs for desktops, Intel® Arc™ GPU-based laptops, and Intel® Arc™ Pro B-series GPUs.\n• Immersive reflections and shadows in your gaming.\n• Experience captivating ray-traced walkthroughs of your next building designs.\nMedia processing\n• Recommended on Intel® Arc™ Pro B-series GPUs, and Intel® Arc™ GPUs for the edge.\n• Enhance video production, media transcoding, and streaming.\n• Convert to higher compression formats for storage and faster on-demand retrieval.\nAI Inferencing\n• Recommended on Intel® Arc™ GPUs for the edge.\n• Deploy advanced AI workloads at the edge with specialized AI engines such as chat-based assistants, automatic object recognition, and object classification.\nResources\nIntel® Arc™ Graphics drivers\nLearn about AI PCs\nWhat’s the difference between CPU vs. GPU?\nIntel gaming\nView All\nView Less\nProduct and Performance Information\n1 AI features may require additional purchase or specific compatibility requirements. See intel.com/performanceindex for details. Results may vary. (As of August 2024.)\n2 AI features may require software purchase, subscription or enablement by a software or platform provider, or may have specific configuration or compatibility requirements. Data latency, cost, and privacy advantages refer to non-cloud-based AI apps. Learn more at intel.com/AIPC.\nAI playground is only compatible with select Intel Arc GPUs that meet minimum graphics memory requirements. Learn more about AI playground at intel.com/ai-playground.\nGet the latest in your inbox\nSubscribe\nCompany\nCompany\nCompany overview\nCorporate Responsibility\nOur Values\nInvestors\nNews\nPress Hub\nCareers\nQuick links\nQuick links\nProducts\nProcessors\nGraphics\nLegal & Privacy\nLegal & Privacy\nPrivacy\nTerms of Use\nTrademarks\nCookies\nNotice of Collections\nYour privacy choices\nCalifornia Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA) Opt-Out Icon\nSupport & Resources\nSupport & Resources\nDownload Center\nSupport\nContact Us\n© Intel Corporation\nIntel technologies may require enabled hardware, software or service activation. No product or component can be absolutely secure. Your costs and results may vary. Performance varies by use, configuration, and other factors. Learn more at intel.com/performanceindex. See our complete legal Notices and Disclaimers. Intel is committed to respecting human rights and avoiding causing or contributing to adverse impacts on human rights. See Intel’s Global Human Rights Principles. Intel’s products and software are intended only to be used in applications that do not cause or contribute to adverse impacts on human rights."
